evidence.quote:
Conjecture 2.14 (Mahler). There exists an absolute constant c > 0 such that
                                    || log a || > a^{-c}
for all integers a ≥ 2.
      Equivalently,
                                  |a - e^b| > a^{-c}
for some absolute constant c > 0 for all integers a, b > 1.
